. * EXTRACT AND EXPORT RESULTS * (Please adapt to fit your reporting format)
. 
.     * Extract required statistics for interaction term (effect of daughters *
>  sex)
. 
.         * (i) coefficient estimate
.         local coefficient = _b[prop_daughters_sex]

. 
.         * (ii) standard error
.         local se = _se[prop_daughters_sex]

. 
.         * (iii) family of the test statistic
.         local test_stat_family = "z"

. 
.         * (iv) model degrees of freedom
.         local df_model = e(df_m)

. 
.         * (v) p-value
.         local z_stat = _b[prop_daughters_sex] / _se[prop_daughters_sex]

.         local p_value = 2 * normal(-abs(`z_stat'))

. 
.         * (vi) number of observations
.         local num_obs = e(N)

. 
.         * (vii) number of participants
.         quietly levelsof pid if e(sample), local(participants)

.         local num_participants : word count `participants'

. 
.         * (viii) interpretation of directionality
.         scalar coef_interaction = _b[prop_daughters_sex]

.                 local interpretation "negative coefficient is in line with hy
> pothesis"

